# Set these in Vercel Project Settings -> Environment Variables.
# Never commit real values. This file documents what's required and why.

# --- Viral Brain Mode B: official Instagram account connection ---------
# Meta App Dashboard -> your app -> App settings -> Basic
META_APP_ID=""
META_APP_SECRET=""
# Exact callback URL registered in the Meta App's Instagram product config.
# Must be https and match exactly, e.g. https://trenddrop-delta.vercel.app/api/instagram-oauth-callback
META_REDIRECT_URI=""

# 32 bytes, base64-encoded. Generate with: openssl rand -base64 32
# Used to AES-256-GCM encrypt the Instagram access token into an httpOnly
# cookie. Never sent to or readable by browser JavaScript.
COOKIE_SECRET=""

# --- Viral Brain Mode C + Meme Remix: Gemini video AI -------------------
# Google AI Studio -> Get API key (free tier: gemini-2.5-flash)
GEMINI_API_KEY=""
